  "raw_label": "1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Mayur Savkar Vidhate vs The State Of Maharashtra on 6 September, 2023 Author: N.J.Jamadar Bench: N.J.Jamadar 22 aba 977 of 2023 In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Criminal Appellate Jurisdiction Anticipatory Bail Application No.977 Of 2023 Mayur Savkar Vidhate ... Applicant versus The State of Maharashtra ... Respondent Mr. Onkar A. Mane, for applicant. Mr. R.M.Pethe, App for State. Coram: N.J.Jamadar, J. Date : 6 September 2023 P.C.",
    "facts": "2. This is an application for pre-arrest bail in connection with C.R.No.43 o 2022 registered with Junnar Police Station for the offences punishable under Sections 328, 188, 272, 273 of the Indian Penal Code and Section 26(2), 26(4), 30(2)(a) of the Foods Safety and Standards Act, 2006. 3. On 4 February 2023 in a raid conducted at a shed in front of the house of Mr. Vidhate at Village Shiroli, contraband articles (gutkha - panmasala) were found to have been stored. The said contraband articles were allegedly stored by the Applicant. 4. By an order dated 3 April 2023, this Court had granted interim protection. Evidently, the contraband articles have been seized and samples have been collected.",
